      
      <div id="tab-shipping" v-show="activeTab === 'shipping'" class="ma-tab-pane">


        {% comment %} ─── SUBTAB: VẬN ĐƠN (2026-08-13) ─── Danh sách mọi vận đơn + detail Sapo-style
             có sidebar. List đơn giản: bảng + bộ lọc. Detail: main (info block + items + timeline) +
             sidebar (status + info + notes + activity). Timeline được ghi từ webhook Goship + refresh
             tracking status (xem _shipmentHistoryLog trong mops_01.js). {% endcomment %}
        <div v-show="shipping.subtab === 'shipments'">
          <div v-if="!shipping.shipmentDetail">
            <button type="button" @click="mobileFilterOpen = true"
              class="ma-filter-trigger items-center gap-2 w-full justify-center mb-stack-md p-3 bg-surface-bright border border-outline-variant rounded-xl text-body-sm font-bold text-on-surface active:scale-95 transition-all">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">tune</span><span>Bộ lọc</span>
              <span v-if="shipmentActiveFilterCount" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center min-w-[20px] h-5 px-1.5 rounded-full text-label-sm font-bold bg-primary text-white">[[ shipmentActiveFilterCount ]]</span>
            </button>
            <div class="ma-toolbar ma-toolbar--sheet flex flex-wrap items-center gap-stack-md p-4 bg-surface-bright border border-outline-variant rounded-xl" :class="{ 'is-filter-open': mobileFilterOpen }">
              <div class="ma-filter-sheet-head"><span class="text-title-sm font-bold text-on-surface">Bộ lọc vận đơn</span><button type="button" @click="mobileFilterOpen = false" class="w-8 h-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">close</span></button></div>
              <input v-model="shipping.shipmentFilters.search" @keyup.enter="loadShipments(); mobileFilterOpen = false" type="text" placeholder="Mã VĐ / mã đơn / SĐT / tên" class="min-w-[200px] flex-1 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-body-sm rounded-lg px-3 py-2">
              <select v-model="shipping.shipmentFilters.carrier_code" @change="loadShipments" class="min-w-[140px] bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-body-sm rounded-lg px-3 py-2">
                <option value="">Tất cả đối tác</option>
                <option value="GOSHIP">Goship</option>
                <option value="GHN">GHN</option>
                <option value="GHTK">GHTK</option>
                <option value="VIETTELPOST">Viettel Post</option>
                <option value="AHAMOVE">Ahamove</option>
                <option value="SELF">Tự giao</option>
              </select>
              <select v-model="shipping.shipmentFilters.status" @change="loadShipments" class="min-w-[160px] bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-body-sm rounded-lg px-3 py-2">
                <option value="">Tất cả trạng thái</option>
                <option value="ready_to_pick">Sẵn sàng lấy hàng</option>
                <option value="delivering">Đang giao hàng</option>
                <option value="redelivery">Chờ giao lại</option>
                <option value="delivered">Đã giao hàng</option>
                <option value="delivery_cancelled">Huỷ giao hàng</option>
                <option value="returned">Đã hoàn hàng</option>
              </select>
              <input v-model="shipping.shipmentFilters.from" @change="loadShipments" type="date" class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-body-sm rounded-lg px-3 py-2" title="Từ ngày">
              <input v-model="shipping.shipmentFilters.to" @change="loadShipments" type="date" class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-body-sm rounded-lg px-3 py-2" title="Đến ngày">
              <button @click="loadShipments(); mobileFilterOpen = false" type="button" class="ma-btn-primary">Tải lại</button>
            </div>
            
        {% comment %} 2026-08-23 — STATUS TABS. 2026-08-30: đổi visual từ chip nền-tròn sang tab-gạch-chân
             khớp UI mẫu Sapo (border-bottom 2px khi active, chữ phẳng không nền) — GIỮ NGUYÊN đủ 8 mục/
             code/hành vi cũ, chỉ đổi style. Hiện chỉ ở subtab='shipments' + không đang xem detail. 8 tab
             filter theo fulfillment_status: '' Tất cả, ready_to_pick Chờ lấy, delivering Đang giao,
             redelivery Giao lại, delivered Đã giao, returned Chuyển hoàn, delivery_cancelled Huỷ giao,
             cancelled Đã huỷ. Click tab → set filter + reload list_shipments (backend đã support param
             status). Không phá select dropdown cũ trong bộ lọc chi tiết — cả 2 UI cùng bind
             shipping.shipmentFilters.status. {% endcomment %}
        <div v-if="shipping.subtab === 'shipments' && !shipping.shipmentDetail"
             class="ma-chip-scroll flex gap-4 overflow-x-auto border-b border-outline-variant">
          <template v-for="chip in [
              { code: '',                  label: 'Tất cả vận đơn' },
              { code: 'ready_to_pick',     label: 'Chờ lấy hàng' },
              { code: 'delivering',        label: 'Đang giao hàng' },
              { code: 'redelivery',        label: 'Chờ giao lại' },
              { code: 'delivered',         label: 'Đã giao hàng' },
              { code: 'returned',          label: 'Chuyển hoàn' },
              { code: 'delivery_cancelled',label: 'Huỷ giao hàng' },
              { code: 'cancelled',         label: 'Đã huỷ' }
            ]" :key="chip.code || 'all'">
            <button type="button" @click="setShipmentStatusFilter(chip.code)"
                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-1 py-2 text-label-md whitespace-nowrap border-b-2 -mb-px transition-colors"
                    :class="(shipping.shipmentFilters.status || '') === chip.code
                              ? 'border-primary text-primary font-bold'
                              : 'border-transparent text-on-surface-variant font-semibold hover:text-on-surface'">
              <span>[[ chip.label ]]</span>
              <span v-if="(shipping.shipmentFilters.status || '') === chip.code && shipping.shipmentsTotal"
                    class="ml-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center min-w-[20px] h-[18px] px-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-primary text-white font-mono">[[ shipping.shipmentsTotal ]]</span>
            </button>
          </template>
        </div>
            <div class="ma-filter-backdrop" v-if="mobileFilterOpen" @click="mobileFilterOpen = false"></div>
            <div v-if="shipping.shipmentsLoading" class="ma-table-skeleton" aria-label="Đang tải vận đơn"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div v-else-if="!shipping.shipmentsList.length" class="ma-empty-state">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant text-[56px] opacity-[.35]">local_shipping</span>
              <p class="ma-empty-hint">Chưa có vận đơn nào khớp bộ lọc.</p>
            </div>
            <div v-else class="ma-card"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="ma-table ma-data-table">
              <thead>
                <!-- 2026-08-30 — khi có vận đơn được chọn, thay cả hàng tiêu đề bằng thanh
                     "Đã chọn N · Chọn thao tác" (khớp bố cục Sapo mẫu), thay cho floating bar cũ ở
                     đáy trang. Menu chỉ gồm action thật đã có sẵn (in tem Goship/MOPS, in phiếu giao
                     hàng) — không thêm "Cập nhật trạng thái"/"In hướng dẫn đóng gói" vì MOPS chưa có
                     hàm bulk tương ứng. -->
                <tr v-if="labelPrint.selectedIds.length > 0" class="ma-thead-row">
                  <th class="px-3 py-2" colspan="10">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
                      <input type="checkbox" aria-label="Chọn tất cả vận đơn"
                             :checked="shipmentsSelectionState === 'all'"
                             :class="{ 'ma-check-indeterminate': shipmentsSelectionState === 'some' }"
                             @change="toggleAllShipmentsSelected"
                             class="rounded border-outline-variant">
                      <span class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Đã chọn <b class="text-on-surface">[[ labelPrint.selectedIds.length ]]</b> vận đơn</span>
                      <div class="relative">
                        <button type="button" @click="shipping.bulkMenuOpen = !shipping.bulkMenuOpen"
                                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-outline-variant rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-label-md font-bold hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors bg-surface-container-lowest">
                          Chọn thao tác
                          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">[[ shipping.bulkMenuOpen ? 'expand_less' : 'expand_more' ]]</span>
                        </button>
                        <div v-if="shipping.bulkMenuOpen" class="fixed inset-0 z-40" @click="shipping.bulkMenuOpen = false"></div>
                        <div v-if="shipping.bulkMenuOpen" class="absolute z-50 mt-1 w-72 border border-outline-variant rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
                          <button type="button" @click="shipping.bulkMenuOpen = false; bulkPrintGoshipLabels()" :disabled="labelPrint.bulkBusy"
                                  class="w-full flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-left text-body-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors border-b border-outline-variant disabled:opacity-50">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" :class="{ 'ma-spin': labelPrint.bulkBusy }">[[ labelPrint.bulkBusy ? 'progress_activity' : 'print' ]]</span>In tem Goship
                          </button>
                          <button type="button" @click="shipping.bulkMenuOpen = false; bulkPrintMopsLabels()" :disabled="labelPrint.bulkBusy"
                                  class="w-full flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-left text-body-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors border-b border-outline-variant disabled:opacity-50"
                                  title="Dùng khi Goship chưa trả PDF hoặc muốn kiểm soát layout MOPS">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">receipt_long</span>In tem MOPS
                          </button>
                          <label class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-body-sm border-b border-outline-variant cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container-low" title="Ẩn tên sản phẩm khi in tem MOPS hàng loạt (không áp dụng cho In tem Goship)">
                            <input type="checkbox" v-model="labelPrint.hideProductDetails" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" @click.stop>
                            Ẩn tên hàng khi in tem MOPS
                          </label>
                          <button type="button" @click="shipping.bulkMenuOpen = false; bulkPrintShipmentSlips()" :disabled="labelPrint.slipBulkBusy"
                                  class="w-full flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-left text-body-sm hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors border-b border-outline-variant disabled:opacity-50"
                                  title="Phiếu giao hàng A5/A4: người nhận + địa chỉ + bảng hàng + số COD cần thu">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" :class="{ 'ma-spin': labelPrint.slipBulkBusy }">[[ labelPrint.slipBulkBusy ? 'progress_activity' : 'description' ]]</span>In phiếu giao hàng
                          </button>
                          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant" @click.stop>
                            <span class="flex-shrink-0">Khổ giấy:</span>
                            <select v-model="labelPrint.slipPaperSize" class="flex-1 border border-outline-variant rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-label-sm">
                              <option value="A5">A5 (mặc định)</option>
                              <option value="A4">A4</option>
                              <option value="K80">K80 (nhiệt 80mm)</option>
                            </select>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <button type="button" @click="clearShipmentsSelection" class="ml-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-error">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">close</span>Bỏ chọn
                      </button>
                    </div>
                  </th>
                </tr>
                <tr v-else class="ma-thead-row">
                  <!-- 2026-08-23 master checkbox bulk print vận đơn (Mục 4 plan OMS). STRICT BOUNDARY:
                       nút bulk chỉ in TEM A6 (Goship PDF hoặc MOPS fallback), KHÔNG in đơn hàng. -->
                  <th class="w-10 px-3 py-3">
                    <input type="checkbox" aria-label="Chọn tất cả vận đơn"
                           :checked="shipmentsSelectionState === 'all'"
                           :class="{ 'ma-check-indeterminate': shipmentsSelectionState === 'some' }"
                           @change="toggleAllShipmentsSelected"
                           class="rounded border-outline-variant">
                  </th>
                  <th class="ma-th-lg">Mã vận đơn</th>
                  <th class="ma-th-lg">Đơn hàng</th>
                  <th class="ma-th-lg">Người nhận</th>
                  <th class="ma-th-lg">Đối tác</th>
                  <th class="ma-th-lg">Trạng thái</th>
                  <th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">COD</th>
                  <th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">Phí</th>
                  <th class="ma-th-lg">Ngày đóng gói</th>
                  <th class="w-44 px-3 py-3 text-right font-label-md uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Thao tác</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="ma-rows-divide">
                <tr v-for="s in shipping.shipmentsList" :key="s.tracking_code + '|' + s.order_id" class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/50 cursor-pointer" @click="openShipmentDetail(s.order_id)">
                  <td class="px-3 py-3" @click.stop>
                    <input type="checkbox" :aria-label="'Chọn vận đơn ' + s.tracking_code"
                           :checked="isShipmentSelected(s.order_id)"
                           @change="toggleShipmentSelected(s.order_id, $event)"
                           class="rounded border-outline-variant">
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-primary">[[ s.tracking_code ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Đơn hàng" class="px-6 py-4 text-body-sm">[[ s.order_id ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Người nhận" class="px-6 py-4">
                    <div class="font-semibold">[[ s.receiver_name || '—' ]]</div>
                    <div class="text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ s.receiver_phone ]]</div>
                  </td>
                  <td data-label="Đối tác" class="px-6 py-4 text-body-sm">[[ s.carrier || s.carrier_code ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Trạng thái" class="px-6 py-4"><span class="ma-badge" :class="'ma-badge--' + (s.status_badge || 'neutral')">[[ s.status_text ]]</span></td>
                  <td data-label="COD" class="px-6 py-4 text-right">[[ formatMoney(s.cod_amount) ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Phí" class="px-6 py-4 text-right">[[ formatMoney(s.shipping_fee) ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Ngày đóng gói" class="px-6 py-4 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ s.packed_at ? formatDate(s.packed_at) : '—' ]]</td>
                  <!-- 2026-08-27 cột Thao tác — mẫu ma-icon-btn giống tab Đơn hàng. In tem A6 luôn
                       hoạt động (fallback template MOPS nếu Goship không trả PDF). Giục giao chỉ hiện
                       khi đơn còn "sống" (đang lấy/đang giao); Xử lý hoàn chỉ hiện khi đơn đã hoàn/huỷ
                       giao/chờ giao lại — cả 2 dùng chung ý nghĩa "cần chú ý", không phải action hãng thật. -->
                  <td class="px-3 py-3" @click.stop>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 justify-end">
                      <button @click="openPrintModal(s.order_id)" type="button"
                              class="ma-icon-btn" aria-label="In vận đơn" title="Tuỳ chỉnh &amp; in vận đơn">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">print</span>
                      </button>
                      <button v-if="['ready_to_pick','delivering'].indexOf(s.fulfillment_status) !== -1"
                              @click="urgeShipment(s.order_id)" :disabled="labelPrint.urgeBusy === s.order_id" type="button"
                              class="ma-icon-btn text-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-50" aria-label="Giục giao" title="Giục giao — ghi vào lịch sử vận đơn, không gọi được API đối tác">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" :class="{ 'ma-spin': labelPrint.urgeBusy === s.order_id }">[[ labelPrint.urgeBusy === s.order_id ? 'progress_activity' : 'bolt' ]]</span>
                      </button>
                      <button v-if="['redelivery','delivery_cancelled','returned'].indexOf(s.fulfillment_status) !== -1"
                              @click="openShipmentDetail(s.order_id)" type="button"
                              class="ma-icon-btn text-primary" aria-label="Xử lý hoàn/giao lại" title="Xử lý hoàn/giao lại">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">undo</span>
                      </button>
                      <button @click="openShipmentDetail(s.order_id)" type="button"
                              class="ma-icon-btn" aria-label="Xem chi tiết" title="Xem chi tiết">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">visibility</span>
                      </button>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table></div>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant px-6 pb-4">[[ shipping.shipmentsList.length ]] / [[ shipping.shipmentsTotal ]] vận đơn</p></div>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} ─── DETAIL v2 (2026-08-16) — layout đồng bộ Order/Product/Customer:
               sticky header + grid 7fr/3fr + card pattern chuẩn. Cột trái: Giao nhận / Sản phẩm /
               Lịch sử thao tác + timeline. Cột phải sticky top: Tình trạng / Cước & Phí / Ghi chú.
               Skeleton dựa vào __snapshot cờ do openShipmentDetail seed từ row list để UI không đơ. {%- endcomment -%}
          <section v-else class="ma-workspace-detail text-on-surface font-body-sm">

            {%- comment -%} STICKY HEADER: back + tracking + status badge + action buttons {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="sticky top-0 z-10 flex flex-none items-center gap-3 border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-4 py-3 md:px-6">
              <button @click="closeShipmentDetail" type="button"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-label-md font-bold text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_back</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">Danh sách vận đơn</span>
              </button>
              <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2 truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                <span>Vận đơn</span><span class="text-outline">/</span>
                <span class="truncate font-semibold font-mono text-primary">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.tracking_code || '—' ]]</span>
                <span v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.status_text" class="ma-badge shrink-0" :class="'ma-badge--' + (shipping.shipmentDetail.status_badge || 'neutral')">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.status_text ]]</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <button @click="refreshShipmentStatus" :disabled="shipping.detailActing" type="button"
                  class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-outline-variant px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-label-md font-bold hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors disabled:opacity-50" title="Nạp lại trạng thái từ đối tác vận chuyển">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" :class="{ 'ma-spin': shipping.detailActing }">refresh</span>
                  <span class="hidden sm:inline">[[ shipping.detailActing ? 'Đang nạp…' : 'Nạp lại' ]]</span>
                </button>
                <button @click="openPrintModal(shipping.shipmentDetail.order_id)" type="button"
                  class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-primary/40 bg-primary/5 text-primary px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-label-md font-bold hover:bg-primary/10 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">print</span>
                  <span class="hidden sm:inline">In vận đơn</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 md:p-6">
              <div v-if="shipping.detailLoading && shipping.shipmentDetail.__snapshot" class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2 text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant" role="status">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined ma-spin text-[16px]">progress_activity</span>Đang tải chi tiết vận đơn…
              </div>

              {%- comment -%} GRID 7fr/3fr — stack trên mobile, sticky cột phụ trên xl. {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,7fr)_minmax(0,3fr)]">

                {%- comment -%} ═══════════ CỘT CHÍNH (7fr) ═══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
                <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4">

                  {%- comment -%} CARD 1: THÔNG TIN GIAO NHẬN {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2.5">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant">local_shipping</span>
                      <div class="text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">Thông tin giao nhận</div>
                      <span v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.order_id" class="ml-auto text-label-sm font-mono text-on-surface-variant">Đơn [[ shipping.shipmentDetail.order_id ]]</span>
                    </div>
                    <div v-if="shipping.detailLoading && shipping.shipmentDetail.__snapshot && !shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address" class="ma-component-skeleton" aria-label="Đang tải thông tin giao nhận"><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span></div>
                    <div v-else class="px-3 py-1">
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Người nhận</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm font-semibold text-on-surface">[[ (shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address && shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address.receiver_name) || (shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.customer_name) || shipping.shipmentDetail.receiver_name || '—' ]]</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Số điện thoại</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm font-mono text-on-surface">[[ (shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address && shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address.phone) || (shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.customer_phone) || shipping.shipmentDetail.receiver_phone || '—' ]]</div>
                      </div>
                      <div v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Địa chỉ giao</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm text-on-surface">[[ [shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address.address, shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address.ward, shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address.district, shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_address.province].filter(function(v){return v;}).join(', ') ]]</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Hình thức giao</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm text-on-surface">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.carrier || shipping.shipmentDetail.carrier_code || '—' ]]<template v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_service_id"> · <span class="font-mono text-on-surface-variant">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_service_id ]]</span></template></div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Ngày đóng gói</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm font-mono text-on-surface">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.packed_at ? formatDate(shipping.shipmentDetail.packed_at) : '—' ]]</div>
                      </div>
                      <div v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.last_tracked_at" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[160px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Cập nhật gần nhất</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm font-mono text-on-surface-variant">[[ formatDate(new Date(shipping.shipmentDetail.last_tracked_at * 1000)) ]]</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  {%- comment -%} CARD 2: PHIẾU ĐÓNG GÓI — items table + totals {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2.5">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant">inventory_2</span>
                      <div class="text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">Phiếu đóng gói</div>
                      <span v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.items" class="ml-auto text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.order.items.length ]] mặt hàng</span>
                    </div>
                    <div v-if="shipping.detailLoading && shipping.shipmentDetail.__snapshot && !(shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.items && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.items.length)" class="ma-component-skeleton ma-component-skeleton--table" aria-label="Đang tải phiếu đóng gói"></div>
                    <template v-else>
                      <div class="overflow-x-auto p-2.5">
                        <table class="min-w-[520px] w-full text-left text-body-sm">
                          <thead>
                            <tr>
                              <th class="w-[46%]">Sản phẩm</th>
                              <th class="font-mono">SKU</th>
                              <th class="text-right tabular-nums">Đơn giá</th>
                              <th class="text-right tabular-nums">SL</th>
                              <th class="text-right tabular-nums">Thành tiền</th>
                            </tr>
                          </thead>
                          <tbody>
                            <tr v-for="it in (shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.items || [])" :key="it.id || it.sku">
                              <td>
                                <div class="font-semibold text-on-surface">[[ it.name ]]</div>
                                <div v-if="it.variant_title" class="mt-0.5 text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ it.variant_title ]]</div>
                              </td>
                              <td class="font-mono text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ it.sku || '—' ]]</td>
                              <td class="text-right font-mono tabular-nums">[[ formatMoney(it.price) ]]</td>
                              <td class="text-right tabular-nums">[[ it.qty ]]</td>
                              <td class="text-right font-bold font-mono tabular-nums">[[ formatMoney(it.lineTotal || (it.price * (it.qty || 1))) ]]</td>
                            </tr>
                          </tbody>
                        </table>
                      </div>
                      <div class="border-t border-outline-variant px-3 py-3 space-y-1">
                        <div v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.merchandise_amount != null" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                          <span>Tạm tính</span>
                          <span class="font-mono">[[ formatMoney(shipping.shipmentDetail.order.merchandise_amount + (shipping.shipmentDetail.order.discount_amount || 0)) ]]</span>
                        </div>
                        <div v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.discount_amount" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-body-sm text-error">
                          <span>Chiết khấu</span>
                          <span class="font-mono">−[[ formatMoney(shipping.shipmentDetail.order.discount_amount) ]]</span>
                        </div>
                        <div v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.customer_shipping_fee != null" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                          <span>Phí vận chuyển</span>
                          <span class="font-mono">[[ formatMoney(shipping.shipmentDetail.order.customer_shipping_fee) ]]</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-outline-variant pt-2 text-body-md font-bold text-on-surface">
                          <span>Khách phải trả</span>
                          <span class="font-mono">[[ formatMoney(shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.total_amount) ]]</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </template>
                  </div>

                  {%- comment -%} CARD 3: LỊCH SỬ THAO TÁC & TRẠNG THÁI — merge timeline (webhook ĐVVC)
                       + activity_logs (thao tác nội bộ) trong 1 khối, phân bằng badge type. {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2.5">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant">schedule</span>
                      <div class="text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">Lịch sử &amp; trạng thái</div>
                      <span class="ml-auto text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ (shipping.shipmentDetail.timeline || []).length ]] cập nhật · [[ (shipping.shipmentDetail.activity_logs || []).length ]] thao tác</span>
                    </div>
                    <div v-if="shipping.detailLoading && shipping.shipmentDetail.__snapshot && !((shipping.shipmentDetail.timeline || []).length || (shipping.shipmentDetail.activity_logs || []).length)" class="ma-component-skeleton" aria-label="Đang tải lịch sử"><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span></div>
                    <div v-else class="px-3 py-3">
                      <div v-if="!(shipping.shipmentDetail.timeline || []).length && !(shipping.shipmentDetail.activity_logs || []).length" class="ma-component-empty">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">schedule</span>
                        <span>Chưa có cập nhật nào từ đối tác hoặc nội bộ.</span>
                      </div>
                      <template v-else>
                        {%- comment -%} 2026-08-29: grid 2 cột (Trạng thái từ đối tác | Thao tác nội bộ)
                             thay vì xếp chồng dọc — staff dễ đối chiếu mốc thời gian ĐVVC báo với hành
                             động nội bộ tương ứng. Mobile giữ 1 cột xếp dọc. {%- endcomment -%}
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                          <div v-if="(shipping.shipmentDetail.timeline || []).length">
                            <div class="mb-2 text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Trạng thái từ đối tác</div>
                            <ol class="space-y-3 border-l-2 border-outline-variant pl-4">
                              <li v-for="(t, idx) in shipping.shipmentDetail.timeline" :key="(t.history_id || '') + '|' + idx" class="relative">
                                <div class="absolute -left-[25px] top-0.5 inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[10px]">local_shipping</span></div>
                                <div class="min-w-0">
                                  <div class="text-body-sm font-semibold text-on-surface">[[ t.status_text || t.status_raw ]]</div>
                                  <div class="mt-0.5 text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-mono">[[ formatDate(t.update_time ? new Date(t.update_time * 1000) : t.created_at) ]]<template v-if="t.source"> · <span>[[ t.source ]]</span></template></div>
                                  <div v-if="t.note" class="mt-1 text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ t.note ]]</div>
                                </div>
                              </li>
                            </ol>
                          </div>
                          <div v-if="(shipping.shipmentDetail.activity_logs || []).length">
                            <div class="mb-2 text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Thao tác nội bộ</div>
                            <ol class="space-y-3 border-l-2 border-outline-variant pl-4">
                              <li v-for="a in shipping.shipmentDetail.activity_logs" :key="a.log_id" class="relative">
                                <div class="absolute -left-[25px] top-0.5 inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[10px]">person</span></div>
                                <div class="min-w-0">
                                  <div class="text-body-sm font-semibold text-on-surface">[[ a.label ]]</div>
                                  <div class="mt-0.5 text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant font-mono">[[ formatDate(a.created_at) ]] · [[ a.user || 'Hệ thống' ]]</div>
                                </div>
                              </li>
                            </ol>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </template>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                </div>

                {%- comment -%} ═══════════ CỘT PHỤ (3fr, sticky top xl) ═══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
                <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 xl:sticky xl:top-16 xl:self-start">

                  {%- comment -%} CARD A: TÌNH TRẠNG ĐƠN (status badge + Nạp lại hint) {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2.5">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant">flag</span>
                      <div class="text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">Tình trạng đơn</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3">
                      <div class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="ma-badge" :class="'ma-badge--' + (shipping.shipmentDetail.status_badge || 'neutral')">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.status_text || 'Chưa xác định' ]]</span>
                      </div>
                      <p class="mt-2 text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Trạng thái tự cập nhật khi đối tác gửi webhook. Bấm <b>Nạp lại</b> ở header để hỏi ngay.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  {%- comment -%} CARD B: CƯỚC & PHÍ — KV rows chuẩn + link tracking url {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2.5">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant">payments</span>
                      <div class="text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">Cước &amp; Phí</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="px-3 py-1">
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[130px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Tiền thu hộ COD</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm font-bold font-mono text-on-surface">[[ formatMoney(shipping.shipmentDetail.cod_amount) ]]</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[130px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Phí trả ĐTVC</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm font-mono text-on-surface">[[ formatMoney(shipping.shipmentDetail.shipping_fee) ]]</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[130px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Đóng gói</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm text-on-surface"><span class="font-mono">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.package_weight ? shipping.shipmentDetail.package_weight + 'g' : '—' ]]</span><template v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.package_dims"> · <span class="font-mono">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.package_dims ]] cm</span></template></div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 border-b border-outline-variant/60 py-2 last:border-b-0 sm:grid-cols-[130px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-3">
                        <div class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant">Đối soát</div>
                        <div class="min-w-0 text-body-sm">
                          <template v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.reconciliation">
                            <button @click="openReconDetail(shipping.shipmentDetail.reconciliation.recon_id); shipping.subtab = 'recon'" type="button" class="font-mono font-bold text-primary hover:underline">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.reconciliation.recon_id ]]</button>
                            <div class="text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.reconciliation.status ]]</div>
                          </template>
                          <span v-else class="ma-badge ma-badge--neutral">Chưa đối soát</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.tracking_url" class="border-t border-outline-variant p-3">
                      <a :href="shipping.shipmentDetail.tracking_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-primary font-bold text-label-md hover:underline">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">open_in_new</span>Xem hành trình đầy đủ ở ĐTVC
                      </a>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  {%- comment -%} CARD C: GHI CHÚ ĐƠN (từ khách khi đặt) {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2.5">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-on-surface-variant">sticky_note_2</span>
                      <div class="text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">Ghi chú đơn</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3">
                      <p v-if="shipping.shipmentDetail.order && shipping.shipmentDetail.order.customer_note" class="text-body-sm text-on-surface whitespace-pre-line">[[ shipping.shipmentDetail.order.customer_note ]]</p>
                      <p v-else class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant opacity-70">Không có ghi chú từ khách.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                </div>

              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        
        <div v-show="shipping.subtab === 'recon'">
          
          <div v-if="shipping.detailLoading" class="ma-loading-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary ma-spin text-[32px]">progress_activity</span></div>
          
          <div v-else-if="!shipping.detail">
            <button type="button" @click="mobileFilterOpen = true"
              class="ma-filter-trigger items-center gap-2 w-full justify-center mb-stack-md p-3 bg-surface-bright border border-outline-variant rounded-xl text-body-sm font-bold text-on-surface active:scale-95 transition-all">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">tune</span><span>Bộ lọc</span>
              <span v-if="shipping.filterStatus" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center min-w-[20px] h-5 px-1.5 rounded-full text-label-sm font-bold bg-primary text-white">1</span>
            </button>
            <div class="ma-toolbar ma-toolbar--sheet flex flex-wrap items-center gap-stack-md mb-stack-lg p-4 bg-surface-bright border border-outline-variant rounded-xl" :class="{ 'is-filter-open': mobileFilterOpen }">
              <div class="ma-filter-sheet-head"><span class="text-title-sm font-bold text-on-surface">Bộ lọc đối soát</span><button type="button" @click="mobileFilterOpen = false" class="w-8 h-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">close</span></button></div>
              <select v-model="shipping.filterStatus" @change="loadReconciliations" class="min-w-[160px] bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-body-sm rounded-lg px-3 py-2">
                <option value="">Tất cả trạng thái</option>
                <option value="Chờ đối soát">Chờ đối soát</option>
                <option value="Đã đối soát">Đã đối soát</option>
              </select>
              <button @click="loadReconciliations(); mobileFilterOpen = false" type="button" class="ma-btn-primary">Tải lại</button>
              <button @click="openReconCreate" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary text-on-primary px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-label-md hover:opacity-90 transition-all active:scale-95 ml-auto">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">add</span>Tạo phiếu đối soát
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="ma-filter-backdrop" v-if="mobileFilterOpen" @click="mobileFilterOpen = false"></div>
            <div v-if="shipping.reconLoading" class="ma-table-skeleton" aria-label="Đang tải đối soát vận chuyển"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div v-else-if="shippingReconEmpty" class="ma-empty-state">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant text-[56px] opacity-[.35]">receipt_long</span>
              <p class="ma-empty-hint">[[ shippingReconEmpty ]]</p>
            </div>
            <div v-else class="ma-card"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="ma-table ma-data-table">
              <thead><tr class="ma-thead-row">
                <th class="ma-th-lg">Mã phiếu</th><th class="ma-th-lg">Đối tác</th><th class="ma-th-lg">Trạng thái</th>
                <th class="ma-th-lg">Thanh toán</th><th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">Thực nhận/trả</th><th class="ma-th-lg">Ngày tạo</th><th class="px-6 py-3"></th>
              </tr></thead>
              <tbody class="ma-rows-divide">
                <tr v-for="r in shipping.reconList" :key="r.recon_id" class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/50 cursor-pointer" @click="openReconDetail(r.recon_id)">
                  <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-primary">[[ r.recon_id ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Đối tác" class="px-6 py-4">[[ r.carrier_code ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Trạng thái" class="px-6 py-4"><span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-label-sm font-semibold" :class="shipStatusBadge(r.status)">[[ r.status ]]</span></td>
                  <td data-label="Thanh toán" class="px-6 py-4 text-body-sm">[[ r.payment_status ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Thực nhận/trả" class="px-6 py-4 text-right font-bold" :class="r.net_total < 0 ? 'text-error' : ''">[[ formatMoney(r.net_total) ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Ngày tạo" class="px-6 py-4 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ formatDate(r.created_at) ]]</td>
                  <td class="px-6 py-4 text-right"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant">chevron_right</span></td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table></div>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant px-6 pb-4">[[ shipping.reconList.length ]] phiếu đối soát</p></div>
          </div>

          
          <div v-else class="ma-card p-stack-lg">
            <button @click="shipping.detail = null" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-primary font-bold text-label-md mb-3 hover:underline"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_back</span>Về danh sách</button>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-heading-sm font-bold">Phiếu [[ shipping.detail.recon_id ]] · [[ shipping.detail.carrier_code ]]</h3>
                <span class="inline-block mt-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-label-sm font-semibold" :class="shipStatusBadge(shipping.detail.status)">[[ shipping.detail.status ]]</span>
                <span class="ml-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">[[ shipping.detail.payment_status ]]</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-2">
                <button v-if="shipping.detail.status === 'Chờ đối soát'" @click="confirmRecon" :disabled="shipping.acting || shipping.detail.has_discrepancy" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-label-md hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-all disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">fact_check</span>Xác nhận đối soát
                </button>
                <button v-if="shipping.detail.status === 'Đã đối soát' && shipping.detail.payment_status !== 'Đã thanh toán'" @click="payRecon" :disabled="shipping.acting" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary text-on-primary px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-label-md hover:opacity-90 transition-all disabled:opacity-40">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">payments</span>Thanh toán công nợ
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div v-if="shipping.detail.has_discrepancy" class="mb-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-error-container text-on-error-container text-body-sm font-semibold">⚠️ Còn chênh lệch COD/Phí — sửa giá trị đối tác cho khớp (chênh lệch = 0) trước khi xác nhận.</div>

            
            <div v-if="shipping.detail.carrier_code === 'GOSHIP' && shipping.detail.status === 'Chờ đối soát'"
              class="mb-4 p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-2">
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <label class="text-label-md font-bold">Nạp số liệu thực từ Goship</label>
                  <select v-model="shipping.goshipInvoiceCode" class="w-full h-9 mt-1 px-3 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface text-body-sm">
                    <option value="">— Chọn kỳ đối soát Goship —</option>
                    <option v-for="inv in shipping.goshipInvoices" :key="inv.id" :value="inv.id">[[ inv.id ]] · [[ formatMoney(inv.amount) ]] · [[ inv.count ]] vận đơn</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <button @click="loadGoshipInvoices" :disabled="shipping.goshipLoading" type="button" class="h-9 px-3 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant font-bold text-label-md hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors disabled:opacity-40">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] align-middle" :class="shipping.goshipLoading ? 'ma-spin' : ''">refresh</span> Tải kỳ
                </button>
                <button @click="importGoshipInvoice" :disabled="!shipping.goshipInvoiceCode || shipping.goshipImporting" type="button" class="h-9 px-4 rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary font-bold text-label-md hover:opacity-90 transition-all disabled:opacity-40">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] align-middle">download</span> [[ shipping.goshipImporting ? 'Đang nạp…' : 'Nạp số liệu' ]]
                </button>
              </div>
              <p class="text-label-sm ma-text-sub mt-2">Nạp xong vẫn phải kiểm lại: dòng nào Goship không có sẽ giữ nguyên và hiện chênh lệch đỏ.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant"><div class="ma-text-sub">COD đối tác</div><div class="font-bold">[[ formatMoney(shipping.detail.total_cod_partner) ]]</div></div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant"><div class="ma-text-sub">Phí đối tác</div><div class="font-bold">[[ formatMoney(shipping.detail.total_fee_partner) ]]</div></div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant"><div class="ma-text-sub">Phí khác</div><div class="font-bold">[[ formatMoney(shipping.detail.total_other) ]]</div></div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-primary/5 border border-primary/30"><div class="ma-text-sub">Thực nhận/trả</div><div class="font-bold text-lg" :class="shipping.detail.net_total < 0 ? 'text-error' : 'text-primary'">[[ formatMoney(shipping.detail.net_total) ]]</div></div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="ma-table ma-data-table text-body-sm">
              <thead><tr class="ma-thead-row">
                <th class="px-3 py-2">Mã vận đơn</th>
                <th class="px-3 py-2 text-right">COD hệ thống</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-right">COD đối tác</th>
                <th class="px-3 py-2 text-right">Phí hệ thống</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-right">Phí đối tác</th>
                <th class="px-3 py-2 text-right">Phí khác</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-right">Chênh lệch</th><th class="px-3 py-2"></th>
              </tr></thead>
              <tbody class="ma-rows-divide">
                <tr v-for="it in shipping.detail.items" :key="it.item_id">
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold">[[ it.tracking_code ]]<div class="ma-text-sub">[[ it.order_id ]]</div></td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-right">[[ formatMoney(it.cod_system) ]]</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-right">
                    <input v-if="shipping.detail.status === 'Chờ đối soát'" type="number" v-model.number="it.cod_partner" class="w-24 px-2 py-1 text-right border border-outline-variant rounded bg-surface">
                    <span v-else>[[ formatMoney(it.cod_partner) ]]</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-right">[[ formatMoney(it.fee_system) ]]</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-right">
                    <input v-if="shipping.detail.status === 'Chờ đối soát'" type="number" v-model.number="it.fee_partner" class="w-24 px-2 py-1 text-right border border-outline-variant rounded bg-surface">
                    <span v-else>[[ formatMoney(it.fee_partner) ]]</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-right">
                    <input v-if="shipping.detail.status === 'Chờ đối soát'" type="number" v-model.number="it.other_fee" class="w-20 px-2 py-1 text-right border border-outline-variant rounded bg-surface">
                    <span v-else>[[ formatMoney(it.other_fee) ]]</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-right font-bold" :class="(it.cod_diff !== 0 || it.fee_diff !== 0) ? 'text-error' : 'text-emerald-600'">
                    <span v-if="it.cod_diff !== 0">COD [[ formatMoney(it.cod_diff) ]]<br></span>
                    <span v-if="it.fee_diff !== 0">Phí [[ formatMoney(it.fee_diff) ]]</span>
                    <span v-if="it.cod_diff === 0 && it.fee_diff === 0">Khớp</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-right">
                    <button v-if="shipping.detail.status === 'Chờ đối soát'" @click="saveReconItem(it)" :disabled="shipping.acting" type="button" class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold text-label-sm hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors">Lưu</button>
                    <!-- In vận đơn — chỉ cần item có order_id, không còn giới hạn theo carrier vì modal tự dựng cả 3 layout. -->
                    <button v-if="it.order_id" @click="openPrintModal(it.order_id)" type="button" class="ml-1 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-outline-variant text-label-sm text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-low disabled:opacity-50" title="Tuỳ chỉnh &amp; in vận đơn">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] align-middle">print</span>
                    </button>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table></div>
          </div>

          
          <div v-if="shipping.createForm.show" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/40 p-4" @click.self="shipping.createForm.show = false">
            <div class="bg-surface-bright rounded-2xl shadow-xl max-w-md w-full p-stack-lg">
              <h3 class="text-heading-sm font-bold mb-4">Tạo phiếu đối soát</h3>
              <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">Kéo mọi vận đơn Đã giao/Đã hoàn của đối tác trong khoảng thời gian, chưa nằm trong phiếu nào.</p>
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div>
                  <label class="text-label-md font-bold">Đối tác vận chuyển</label>
                  <select v-model="shipping.createForm.carrier_code" class="w-full h-9 mt-1 px-3 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface text-body-sm">
                    <option v-for="c in shipping.carriers" :key="c.carrier_code" :value="c.carrier_code">[[ c.name ]]</option>
                    <option v-if="!shipping.carriers.length" value="GHN">GHN</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                  <div><label class="text-label-md font-bold">Từ ngày</label><input type="date" v-model="shipping.createForm.from" class="w-full h-9 mt-1 px-3 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface text-body-sm"></div>
                  <div><label class="text-label-md font-bold">Đến ngày</label><input type="date" v-model="shipping.createForm.to" class="w-full h-9 mt-1 px-3 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface text-body-sm"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-2 mt-5">
                <button @click="submitReconCreate" :disabled="shipping.createForm.creating" type="button" class="flex-1 bg-primary text-on-primary py-2.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-label-md hover:opacity-90 disabled:opacity-40">[[ shipping.createForm.creating ? 'Đang tạo...' : 'Tạo phiếu' ]]</button>
                <button @click="shipping.createForm.show = false" type="button" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant font-bold text-label-md">Huỷ</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        
        <div v-show="shipping.subtab === 'report'">
          <button type="button" @click="mobileFilterOpen = true"
            class="ma-filter-trigger items-center gap-2 w-full justify-center mb-stack-md p-3 bg-surface-bright border border-outline-variant rounded-xl text-body-sm font-bold text-on-surface active:scale-95 transition-all">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">tune</span><span>Bộ lọc</span>
            <span v-if="(shipping.reportFrom?1:0)+(shipping.reportTo?1:0)" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center min-w-[20px] h-5 px-1.5 rounded-full text-label-sm font-bold bg-primary text-white">[[ (shipping.reportFrom?1:0)+(shipping.reportTo?1:0) ]]</span>
          </button>
          <div class="ma-toolbar ma-toolbar--sheet flex flex-wrap items-center gap-stack-md mb-stack-lg p-4 bg-surface-bright border border-outline-variant rounded-xl" :class="{ 'is-filter-open': mobileFilterOpen }">
            <div class="ma-filter-sheet-head"><span class="text-title-sm font-bold text-on-surface">Bộ lọc báo cáo</span><button type="button" @click="mobileFilterOpen = false" class="w-8 h-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">close</span></button></div>
            <label class="ma-text-sub">Từ</label><input type="date" v-model="shipping.reportFrom" class="ma-input-inline">
            <label class="ma-text-sub">đến</label><input type="date" v-model="shipping.reportTo" class="ma-input-inline">
            <button @click="loadShippingReport(); mobileFilterOpen = false" type="button" class="ma-btn-primary">Xem báo cáo</button>
          </div>
          <div class="ma-filter-backdrop" v-if="mobileFilterOpen" @click="mobileFilterOpen = false"></div>
          <div v-if="shipping.reportLoading" class="ma-table-skeleton" aria-label="Đang tải báo cáo vận chuyển"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div v-else-if="shipping.report && !shipping.report.total_waybills" class="ma-empty-state">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant text-[56px] opacity-[.35]">local_shipping</span>
            <p class="ma-empty-hint">Chưa có vận đơn nào trong khoảng thời gian này.</p>
          </div>
          <div v-else-if="shipping.report">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant"><div class="ma-text-sub">Tổng vận đơn</div><div class="font-bold text-lg">[[ shipping.report.total_waybills ]]</div></div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant"><div class="ma-text-sub">Tổng phí ship</div><div class="font-bold text-lg">[[ formatMoney(shipping.report.total_fee) ]]</div></div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant"><div class="ma-text-sub">Tổng COD</div><div class="font-bold text-lg">[[ formatMoney(shipping.report.total_cod) ]]</div></div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant"><div class="ma-text-sub">Phí TB/đơn</div><div class="font-bold text-lg">[[ formatMoney(shipping.report.avg_fee) ]]</div></div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-primary/5 border border-primary/30"><div class="ma-text-sub">% giao thành công</div><div class="font-bold text-lg text-primary">[[ shipping.report.success_rate ]]%</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ma-card"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="ma-table ma-data-table">
              <thead><tr class="ma-thead-row">
                <th class="ma-th-lg">Đối tác</th><th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">Vận đơn</th><th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">Tỉ trọng VĐ</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">Tổng phí</th><th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">Tỉ trọng phí</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">Phí TB</th><th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">Phí/COD</th><th class="px-6 py-3 text-right">% giao TC</th>
              </tr></thead>
              <tbody class="ma-rows-divide">
                <tr v-for="c in shipping.report.by_carrier" :key="c.carrier">
                  <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">[[ c.carrier ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Vận đơn" class="px-6 py-4 text-right">[[ c.waybills ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Tỉ trọng VĐ" class="px-6 py-4 text-right">[[ c.waybill_share ]]%</td>
                  <td data-label="Tổng phí" class="px-6 py-4 text-right">[[ formatMoney(c.fee) ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Tỉ trọng phí" class="px-6 py-4 text-right">[[ c.fee_share ]]%</td>
                  <td data-label="Phí TB" class="px-6 py-4 text-right">[[ formatMoney(c.avg_fee) ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="Phí/COD" class="px-6 py-4 text-right">[[ c.fee_cod_ratio ]]</td>
                  <td data-label="% giao TC" class="px-6 py-4 text-right font-semibold">[[ c.success_rate ]]%</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table></div></div>
          </div>
          <div v-else class="ma-empty-state"><p class="ma-empty-hint">Chọn khoảng thời gian rồi bấm "Xem báo cáo".</p></div>
        </div>

        
        <div v-show="shipping.subtab === 'carriers'">
          <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-3">Mỗi đối tác có cấu hình riêng tại tab <strong>Cấu hình</strong>. Chỉ bật kết nối sau khi token/credential và địa chỉ gửi hàng đã hợp lệ.</p>
          <div v-if="shipping.carriersLoading" class="ma-table-skeleton" aria-label="Đang tải đơn vị vận chuyển"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div v-else class="ma-card"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="ma-table ma-data-table">
            <thead><tr class="ma-thead-row"><th class="ma-th-lg">Mã</th><th class="ma-th-lg">Tên</th><th class="ma-th-lg">Phân loại</th><th class="ma-th-lg">Cấu hình</th><th class="ma-th-lg">Kết nối</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="ma-rows-divide">
              <tr v-for="c in shipping.carriers" :key="c.carrier_code">
                <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">[[ c.carrier_code ]]</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4">[[ c.name ]]</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-body-sm">[[ c.category ]]</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4"><span :class="c.registry_pending ? 'text-amber-600' : (c.has_config ? 'text-emerald-600' : 'text-amber-600')" class="text-label-sm font-semibold">[[ c.registry_pending ? 'Cần deploy backend' : (c.has_config ? '✓ Đã cấu hình' : 'Chưa cấu hình') ]]</span></td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4">
                  <button @click="toggleCarrier(c)" type="button" :disabled="shipping.carrierBusy === c.carrier_code || c.registry_pending" class="ma-badge transition-all disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed cursor-pointer" :class="c.connected ? 'ma-badge--success' : 'ma-badge--neutral'">[[ c.registry_pending ? 'Chờ deploy' : (c.connected ? 'Đã kết nối' : 'Ngưng') ]]</button>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div></div>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%}
          2026-08-28 — Modal "Tuỳ chỉnh in" (openPrintModal, Assets/mops-admin-shipping.js.bwt). Đặt
          top-level trong #tab-shipping (không lồng trong 1 subtab cụ thể) vì có thể mở từ list vận
          đơn, shipment detail, và item đối soát — cả 3 subtab khác nhau. Theo đúng hợp đồng modal
          dùng chung: .ma-modal-backdrop + .ma-modal + .ma-modal-head/body/foot (xem shipModal ở
          mops_admin_tab_orders.bwt), KHÔNG tự chế class riêng.
          2026-08-29: bọc <teleport to="body"> — #tab-shipping nằm sâu trong nhiều lớp div cha (bảng
          overflow-x-auto, subtab wrapper...); nếu ancestor nào có transform/overflow thì position:fixed
          của modal bị "nhốt" lại trong ancestor đó thay vì bung ra toàn viewport (modal vẫn tồn tại
          trong DOM — querySelector tìm thấy — nhưng vô hình/kẹt, bấm nút không thấy gì). Cùng convention
          teleport đã dùng cho menu ở mops_admin_tab_finance.bwt/mops_admin_tab_inventory.bwt.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <teleport to="body">
        <div v-if="printModal.show" class="ma-modal-backdrop" @click.self="closePrintModal">
        <div class="ma-modal ma-modal-print" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="In vận đơn">
          <div class="ma-modal-head">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined ma-modal-icon">print</span>
            <div class="ma-modal-title">In vận đơn<template v-if="printModal.order"> · <span class="font-mono ma-fr__val--muted">[[ printModal.order.order_id ]]</span></template></div>
            <button @click="closePrintModal" type="button" class="ma-modal-close" aria-label="Đóng">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">close</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="ma-modal-body">
            <!-- 2026-08-29: skeleton dựng theo hình bố cục thật (nút chuyển layout + field bên trái,
                 khối preview bên phải) thay vì loader trơn — dùng lại nguyên primitive
                 .ma-component-skeleton* đã có (không tự chế class riêng). -->
            <div v-if="printModal.loading" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4" aria-label="Đang tải dữ liệu in">
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="ma-component-skeleton ma-component-skeleton--actions"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
                <div class="ma-component-skeleton"><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span><span class="ma-component-skeleton__line"></span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="ma-component-skeleton ma-component-skeleton--table"></div>
            </div>

            <template v-else-if="printModal.order">
              <div class="flex gap-2">
                <button type="button" @click="setPrintLayout('goship')" class="ma-btn ma-btn--sm" :class="printModal.layout === 'goship' ? 'ma-btn--primary' : 'ma-btn--outline'">Goship</button>
                <button type="button" @click="setPrintLayout('mops')" class="ma-btn ma-btn--sm" :class="printModal.layout === 'mops' ? 'ma-btn--primary' : 'ma-btn--outline'">MOPS</button>
                <button type="button" @click="setPrintLayout('sale')" class="ma-btn ma-btn--sm" :class="printModal.layout === 'sale' ? 'ma-btn--primary' : 'ma-btn--outline'">Bán hàng</button>
              </div>

              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3">
                <div class="space-y-3">
                  <div>
                    <!-- 2026-08-29: tách khỏi "Ghi chú giao hàng" — đây là CHÍNH SÁCH KIỂM HÀNG của
                         shop, in trên MỌI đơn (VD "Cho xem hàng, không cho thử"), khác bản chất với
                         ghi chú riêng theo từng đơn ở dưới. -->
                    <label class="text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant block mb-1">Chính sách kiểm hàng (in trên mọi đơn)</label>
                    <input type="text" v-model="printModal.inspectionTag" @input="refreshPrintPreview" class="ma-input" placeholder="VD: Cho xem hàng, không cho thử">
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <label class="text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant block mb-1">Ghi chú giao hàng (riêng đơn này)</label>
                    <textarea v-model="printModal.note" @input="refreshPrintPreview" rows="2" class="ma-input" placeholder="VD: Gọi trước khi giao"></textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <label class="text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant block mb-1">Tên cửa hàng (người gửi)</label>
                    <input type="text" v-model="printModal.senderName" @input="refreshPrintPreview" class="ma-input">
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <label class="text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant block mb-1">Địa chỉ gửi</label>
                    <input type="text" v-model="printModal.senderAddress" @input="refreshPrintPreview" class="ma-input">
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <label class="text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant block mb-1">SĐT gửi</label>
                    <input type="text" v-model="printModal.senderPhone" @input="refreshPrintPreview" class="ma-input">
                  </div>

                  <div v-if="printModal.layout === 'sale'">
                    <label class="text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant block mb-1">Khổ giấy</label>
                    <select v-model="printModal.saleSize" @change="refreshPrintPreview" class="ma-input">
                      <option value="A5">A5</option>
                      <option value="A4">A4</option>
                      <option value="K80">K80 (nhiệt 80mm)</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <template v-else>
                    <!-- 2026-08-29: nhập tay tự do thay vì checkbox "Ẩn tên sản phẩm" + input riêng —
                         staff tự xoá/sửa trực tiếp tên sản phẩm ngay tại đây khi cần ẩn (VD ghi "Mỹ
                         phẩm chăm sóc da" thay vì tên SKU thật). Tổng SL trên tem vẫn tính từ đơn thật. -->
                    <div>
                      <label class="text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant block mb-1">Nội dung hàng (nhập tay tự do)</label>
                      <textarea v-model="printModal.itemsText" @input="refreshPrintPreview" rows="3" class="ma-input" placeholder="VD: Mỹ phẩm chăm sóc da, SL: 2"></textarea>
                    </div>
                  </template>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <div class="text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Xem trước</div>
                  <div class="ma-print-preview-wrap">
                    <iframe :srcdoc="printModal.previewHtml"
                            class="ma-print-preview-frame"
                            :style="printModal.layout === 'sale' ? 'width:794px;height:1123px;transform:scale(.42)' : 'width:378px;height:567px;transform:scale(.85)'"
                            title="Xem trước bản in"></iframe>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>

          <div class="ma-modal-foot">
            <button @click="closePrintModal" type="button" class="ma-btn ma-btn--outline">Huỷ</button>
            <div class="ma-modal-foot-right">
              <button @click="printFromModal" :disabled="printModal.busy || printModal.loading || !printModal.order" type="button" class="ma-btn ma-btn--primary">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" :class="{ 'ma-spin': printModal.busy }">[[ printModal.busy ? 'progress_activity' : 'print' ]]</span>
                [[ printModal.busy ? 'Đang gửi lệnh in…' : 'In ngay' ]]
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
        </teleport>
      </div>
